  "title_lines": [
   "Chiral effective field theory and nuclear forces"
  ],
  "abstract": "We review how nuclear forces emerge from low-energy QCD via chiral e\ufb00ective \ufb01eld theory. The presentation is accessible to the non-specialist. At the same time, we also provide considerable detailed information (mostly in appendices) for the bene\ufb01t of researchers who wish to start working in this \ufb01eld.",
